window.bookSummaryJSON = "<b>INSTA-LOVE LIKE YOU'VE NEVER SEEN . . .</b><br><br>She was a vision in blue stepping out of a cloud of white steam . . .<br><br>A curvy princess straight out of a dream . . .<br><br>The dream of a dying girl from twenty years ago, as crazy as that sounds.<br><br>I don't know if I'm hallucinating or straight up delusional . . .<br><br>All I know is that she's mine.<br><br>By the gods of astroturf and miracle hail-mary's, she's <i>mine</i>!<br><br><b>Curvyness, drama, and football heroes. Madness, mayhem, and over-the-top steam. Twists, turns, and chaos. Sweetness with a touch of darkness.<br><br>No cheating. No cliffhangers. And your fairy-tale ending, always and forever.<br><br>More insta-love, Annabelle Winters style.<br><br><u>WHAT AMAZON AND GOODREADS REVIEWERS ARE SAYING ABOUT THE CURVY INSTALOVE SERIES:</u></b><br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ I love curvy girl stories! It is so fun to read about these women that most people overlook and find out how strong they really are.<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Unbelievable? Well, of course! But isn’t that what makes it grand?<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ This was soo freaking swoon worthy and it had so much dirty talk.<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Love it great story amazing writing! Thank you so much ❤️❤️❤️.<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Great to read a book with a female character who has curves. Thank you. I’m going to read more of them<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Didn't know what to expect going into this story, but I was pleasantly surprised and sucked in right from the get go.<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Loved this book. It would be an excellent movie. Fun! The author delivers again!<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ This book was absolutely fantastic!! I absolutely loved it!<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ I was not expecting this story to be as entertaining as it was, it had some really funny and entertaining moments in amongst the dark theme.<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Short but totally entertaining!<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ There is a twist I didn't see coming and it made me love this book all the more.<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Great story loved it from the beginning of the first chapter<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Absolute craziness as expected!<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Enjoyed this quick read filled with hot bodies, a psycho killer, and a good girl on the side.<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ For a short book the author gets a plot in that isn't hurried.<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Irreverent, wicked fun!<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Winters has a great way of getting inside her character's minds and bringing it to the reader.<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ The men are usually a bit rough around the edges but lovable all the same��<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ This was a short but get-right-down-to-it naughty book. Loved it!<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ This book is a completely over the top insta-love tale with lots of twists and fun sexy times that will keep you reading.<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ This story threatened to melt my kindle - it is so Steamy! By the time I got about halfway through reading it I was squirming. By the end, I couldn't be still, I was so turned on. This is an awesome book if you like steamy with a side of suspense.<br><br>⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Love reading them can’t wait for more!!"; 
